---
/* ChambersStrip — prominent recognition band (Phase 3 LEGAL-07, D-35).
   The firm's real Chambers USA Spotlight 2026 badge (from the prior site) is
   WHITE artwork on a transparent background — it was designed to sit on a dark
   surface. On the new white page it would be invisible, so it is displayed on
   a near-black band (bg-text = #0A0A0A). This doubles as a deliberate dark
   accent breaking up the white page. Plain <img> served raw from
   /public/chambers-2026.png (no astro:assets optimizer). Non-linked. */
---

<section data-component="ChambersStrip" class="bg-text py-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-gutter">
    <p class="mb-6 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bg/70">
      Recognized by
    </p>
    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <img
        src="/chambers-2026.png"
        alt="Chambers USA Spotlight 2026"
        width="240"
        height="208"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="h-auto w-60"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
